{% comment %}
  DANDY 2026, RAW LEAF POWDER PDP (namespaced; fresh-theme track).
  Deliberately NOT a copy of the gummy PDP. Different buyer: experienced, measures
  their own, buys on value per gram. Therefore:
    - no subscription UI (handoff §4: no launch subscription configured for powder)
    - value-per-gram ladder instead of a per-gummy price
    - "how to measure" replaces "what is kratom"
    - explicit non-interchangeability warning between formats
  Mobile-first. Preview-safe: the CTA never submits.
{% endcomment %}
